  "body": "> I think I'm going to disallow modifying the queue (deleting or moving pictures) while it is running, as it is indeed error prone. Would that be acceptable?\n\nThis is a feature, which is nice, but if it's more save, than disable it. jxl export takes really much time, so if i decide to change a picture again and the first version is still in the queue, so i deleted it. That is not often. Changing the order is not so important if the queue would be faster. Perhaps a change to jxl 0.12, which should be faster (as i read), would help and make the deleting or sorting from the queue obsolete ...\n\nI really appreciate your work.",
